omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z_l_dDDpXnIQ7kNvwG5SvTR&_nc_oc=Adrz2QgPJ0tt037Bz209-xftuq8gdq2jWwKqNaIcFJ6AuB_xmySC-kzhrz-7Hr7K2VU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNZlwT4BYVp1jIxWx6YFyOUBq2sojYczx9NBd5s4JxuuQ&oe=6ADF7034"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aGuJSnyARLcQ7kNvwFijciF&_nc_oc=Adrqc89BUZw2KVrlsLUyl6yliaMpITBrMr9fz8H74fYQoQPG7reFn4xECd-28fsEkpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMFxW2JpaF3wfXIbpDppZoApU5jHXz01EhQNrQjkonR4Q&oe=6ADF7196"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fLADlgVSTCkQ7kNvwG6ar0j&_nc_oc=Adq0QP8gom2nvyh6KcfbJSbA2e7lEzmkEArc85JoP1PMKk2gHtSACUlC8k-1XrCHiDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP3rsPWepYCEZaWav5qfFisIXl8hFBGULeJpPDESAj82Q&oe=6ADF4E77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://